  "Choices Type": "text",
  "Correct Answer": "C",
  "Solution": "The fraction bar groups the numerator and denominator separately, so calculate each before dividing:\n\\[\n\\frac{16+8}{4-2}=\\frac{24}{2}=12.\n\\]\nThe denominator is \\(2\\), so the division is defined. The answer is \\(\\boxed{12}\\), choice \\(\\boxed{\\text{C}}\\).",
